	(text "NOTE 1: Current-limiting resistor\nfor solenoid relay LED. Teensy\n4.1 has max of 4 mA, instead\nof 10 mA for Teensy 3.6.\nFor this particular relay:\nV_f=1.3 V, I_f=3 mA\n\nNOTE 2: Current-limiting resistor\nfor light relay LED. Teensy\n4.1 has max of 4 mA, instead\nof 10 mA for Teensy 3.6.\nFor this particular relay:\nV_f=1.32 V, I_f=3 mA\n\nNote 3: Current-limiting resistor\nfor trial switch LED. Teensy 4.1\nhas max of 4mA output. For this\nLED: V_f=3.2V and 0.5mA required.\n\nNote 4: Current-limiting resisitor\nfor response switch LED. Teensy 4.1\nhas max of 4mA output. For this LED:\nV_f=2.15V.\n\nNOTE 5: Only if using two\nsolenoids\n\nNOTE 6: Only if using\nmicrophone through Teensy"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.732 194.818 0)
		(effects
